。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"opr_t0a_l8g"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p000903"]},{"id":"yg7_rda_vb8","label":"淳于意（扁鵲倉公列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"太倉公","mention_ids":["c-shiji-105-bianque:m010-0000"]},{"surface":"意","mention_ids":["c-shiji-105-bianque:m010-0021","c-shiji-105-bianque:m010-0057","c-shiji-105-bianque:m011-0010","c-shiji-105-bianque:m011-0022","c-shiji-105-bianque:m011-0031","c-shiji-105-bianque:m012-0000","c-shiji-105-bianque:m014-0001","c-shiji-105-bianque:m014-0043","c-shiji-105-bianque:m014-0050","c-shiji-105-bianque:m014-0137","c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0005","c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0027","c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0039","c-shiji-105-bianque:m046-0010","c-shiji-105-bianque:m046-0013","c-shiji-105-bianque:m046-0018","c-shiji-105-bianque:m046-0037","c-shiji-105-bianque:m046-0044","c-shiji-105-bianque:m046-0187","c-shiji-105-bianque:m046-0341","c-shiji-105-bianque:m046-0352","c-shiji-105-bianque:m046-0358","c-shiji-105-bianque:m046-0378","c-shiji-105-bianque:m046-0397","c-shiji-105-bianque:m047-0012","c-shiji-105-bianque:m047-0019","c-shiji-105-bianque:m047-0241"]},{"surface":"臣意","mention_ids":["c-shiji-105-bianque:m013-0006","c-shiji-105-bianque:m013-0071","c-shiji-105-bianque:m014-0127","c-shiji-105-bianque:m014-0145","c-shiji-105-bianque:m014-0249","c-shiji-105-bianque:m015-0011","c-shiji-105-bianque:m015-0095","c-shiji-105-bianque:m016-0012","c-shiji-105-bianque:m016-0058","c-shiji-105-bianque:m017-0020","c-shiji-105-bianque:m017-0055","c-shiji-105-bianque:m018-0008","c-shiji-105-bianque:m018-0148","c-shiji-105-bianque:m019-0007","c-shiji-105-bianque:m019-0031","c-shiji-105-bianque:m019-0083","c-shiji-105-bianque:m020-0009","c-shiji-105-bianque:m020-0102","c-shiji-105-bianque:m020-0219","c-shiji-105-bianque:m021-0011","c-shiji-105-bianque:m021-0026","c-shiji-105-bianque:m021-0085","c-shiji-105-bianque:m022-0009","c-shiji-105-bianque:m022-0020","c-shiji-105-bianque:m022-0075","c-s